// Preset: Flat
// Tags: Square, No shadow
// About: No border, no shadow, square item highlights.
// Source: moudey, Nilesoft Shell issue #79
// https://github.com/moudey/Shell/issues/79: the theme block of the example, verbatim
// (it sat inside a 1.x default { ... } section).
theme
{
    border.enabled=false
    shadow.enabled=false
    item.radius=0
}
